{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/903320-victrix-the-unholy","id":903320,"title":"Victrix & The Unholy","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-30T00:44:41-07:00","id":903320,"title":"Victrix & The Unholy","content":"Reading over The Fall of Rome / Requiem for Rome, I was struck by Victrix. I think she'd make a good background/past for the Unholy, should characters ever investigate the latter's history. Anyway I was wondering if anyone else here connected Victrix and the Unholy (ie they're the same person, or Sire and childe)? Or do we know anything about the Unholy that precludes a connection to Victrix?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#008000\"><b>Freelance Author and Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1713-mistress-of-whispers","name":"mistress of whispers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1713_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-30T01:05:48-07:00","id":903325,"title":"","content":"As far as i know, there's no link between them, but i had thought exactly the same; having the background Victrix has, is all the more plausible for the Unholy to have those... avian features. She/it could be... a symbiosis between Strix and Vampire, or even something like a weird vampire Duguthim, after all that time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Userhat Aegpts Vlrs. </span><span style=\"color:#996633\">Coren &quot;Ojos de Fuego&quot;. </span><span style=\"color:#666699\">Mithrael. </span><span style=\"color:#ffcc00\">Menehet.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1349-phersus","name":"Phersus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1349_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-30T08:53:07-07:00","id":903578,"title":"","content":"Oh yeah, definitely not enough to link them officially. But enough to connect the dots if that's how an ST wants to go. VtR seems to make a point of not being explicit, so that STs can run their own campaigns/histories. Even if the writer of the Victrix intended her as a &quot;young Unholy&quot; they're never gonna come out and say it XD. It's also unlikely to come up in play - not like PCs are gonna be in a position to ask the Unholy a bunch of questions about her youth. I just like speculating about it <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.<br /> <br /> The term &quot;Duguthim&quot; doesn't ring an immediate bell. Which book is it from?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#008000\"><b>Freelance Author and Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1713-mistress-of-whispers","name":"mistress of whispers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1713_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-30T09:29:18-07:00","id":903605,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>mistress of whispers</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/903320-victrix-the-unholy?p=903578#post903578\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The term &amp;quot;Duguthim&amp;quot; doesn't ring an immediate bell. Which book is it from?</div> </div> </div> </div> It's from Werewolf the Forsaken, the First Tongue word for the Claimed- that is to say, where a spirit or a similar being goes beyond possession and actually <i>fuses</i> with its victim, creating a warped monster bearing qualities of both spirit and vessel.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-30T09:39:23-07:00","id":903609,"title":"","content":"Ah, thanks for explaining that. Yeah the Unholy could be a duguthim in theory.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#008000\"><b>Freelance Author and Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1713-mistress-of-whispers","name":"mistress of whispers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1713_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-30T13:21:10-07:00","id":903736,"title":"","content":"What's Victrix's fate in FotC, or is it just down to the player characters? I feel silly for not remembering, having run it not that long ago.<br /> <br /> Regardless, this would be a really cool tie in for long running historical game, or a generational one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-30T14:47:46-07:00","id":903785,"title":"","content":"Sorry for my late reply, but thanks to ZealousChristian you already had the answer. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <br /> <br /> Regarding Victrix's fate, it depends entirely on the players. Once at Senex resting place, when all hell breaks loose, they can bargain with her, or fight her.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Userhat Aegpts Vlrs. </span><span style=\"color:#996633\">Coren &quot;Ojos de Fuego&quot;. </span><span style=\"color:#666699\">Mithrael. </span><span style=\"color:#ffcc00\">Menehet.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1349-phersus","name":"Phersus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1349_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-31T00:23:53-07:00","id":904007,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yossarian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/903320-victrix-the-unholy?p=903736#post903736\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Regardless, this would be a really cool tie in for long running historical game, or a generational one.</div> </div> </div> </div>A generational game could be very cool. Have the players start in Rome with Victrix as (one of) the big bad(s) and then work their way through history (Dark Eras!), with a new character each time. By the time you get to now and the Unholy the PCs probably won't know enough, but it would be so cool if even just the players put the pieces together. I think it could work.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#008000\"><b>Freelance Author and Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1713-mistress-of-whispers","name":"mistress of whispers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1713_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-02T09:43:45-07:00","id":905721,"title":"","content":"A generational game is something i want so much to play. Besides, with these shiny Dark Eras (no pun intended xD) is even easier and cooler to do. The thing is, now i'm caught into Mage's new edition and i keep thinking about playing it with mages... buti don't know why, vampire's seem much more fitting for that kind of game. Anyone knows about the time it will take to comes out the Elder's book &quot;A Thousand years of night&quot; (or so i think it was called)?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Userhat Aegpts Vlrs. </span><span style=\"color:#996633\">Coren &quot;Ojos de Fuego&quot;. </span><span style=\"color:#666699\">Mithrael. </span><span style=\"color:#ffcc00\">Menehet.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1349-phersus","name":"Phersus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1349_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-03T13:57:17-07:00","id":906688,"title":"","content":"A Thousand Years of Night is just entering redlines now. So it's making good progress, but it'll be a while before it's out.<br /> <br /> And running chronicles down the years is definitely something it supports...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}